1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,433
I search the rows with Mia's
binoculars. Mia. Sam. Nana. Frank.
Walt without his lantern. Rosa in her
lilac pyjamas. Every face I love. Eyes
open. Nobody home.

2
00:00:09,933 --> 00:00:18,067
The thought comes before I can stop
it. What if I'm the one they forgot?
What if I'm next? Or what if I'm the
only one the voice couldn't reach?

3
00:00:18,567 --> 00:00:25,233
It can't be the first one. Whatever
sounds like me is not me. I'm standing
here, and I can't stop wheezing.

4
00:00:25,733 --> 00:00:28,567
This is not the fourth rule. But it is
close.

5
00:00:29,067 --> 00:00:34,067
I look at the rows again. And again.
And my stomach drops. There's one face
I can't find.

6
00:00:34,567 --> 00:00:36,333
Kai. My little brother.

7
00:00:36,833 --> 00:00:43,867
I take out the yellow slip from my
pocket and unfold it. Kai's
handwriting. Bus 7:10. School stop,
Cedar Street.
